  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Ambassadors Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Green Ambassadors Kenya Project aims to boost youth-led climate action through inclusive learning, creativity, and collaboration. The project equips young people with tools, training, and platforms to lead change in their communities. It begins with creating an interactive workshop manual that focuses on climate issues in the Kenyan context, participatory Training of Trainers (ToT) workshop where selected youth will become Green Ambassadors. The programme, co-designed with participants, will utilize storytelling, games, and case studies to make the learning an engaging experience. Ambassadors will then develop action plans to apply and share their knowledge, leading to small-scale projects that we will support and help implement.</narrative>
  </description>
